 "intro_zh": "额济纳旗地处亚欧大陆腹地，属于大陆性荒漠气候，具有干旱少雨，日照充足，多风沙等特点，胡杨树是唯一能够在这里生长的树种。胡杨那磅礴向上的气势，向人们展示着不屈不挠的精神，那鬼斧神工般的形态，让人们感受到大自然的壮美。",
 "intro_en": "Alxa League or Alashan League is one of 12 prefecture level divisions and 3 extant leagues, or aimags, of Inner Mongolia. The league borders Mongolia to the north, Bayan Nur to the northeast, Wuhai and Ordos to the east, Ningxia to the southeast, and Gansu to the south and west. The capital is Bayanhot town (Chinese: 巴彦浩特镇), formerly known as Dingyuanying (定远营镇) or Wang Ye Fu, in the aimag's Left Banner. The Mongolian variety spoken in this area is the Alasha dialect.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
